        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fly, drift, and go sleep to dream.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold your wings and float through vast, hand-crafted landscapes — from quiet towns and shimmering lakes to distant valleys kissed by rainbows and moonlight.<br>In <strong>Paper Dawn: Slumbering Wind</strong>, you guide a paper plane through gentle piano melodies and whispering winds. Every breeze can lift you — or tear you apart. Touch anything, and your delicate craft folds into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric flight simulation</strong> — feel the lightness and fragility of a paper plane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic wind system</strong> — even a gasp of air can change your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful world</strong> — populated with birds, animals, and soft ambient life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing piano soundtrack</strong> — designed to calm your mind and lull you toward sleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, meditative experience</strong> — no score, no timer, just quiet flight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let go of control. Drift with the wind.<br>Sometimes the softest crash makes the sweetest sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More maps arriving as free DLC to expand your journey.</strong> In this game, you’ll wander through immersive environments originally crafted for other games by the same developer. These maps, once designed for different adventures, now take center stage as peaceful, standalone experiences. Each one invites you to explore at your own pace, accompanied by calming, sleepy music that sets a tranquil tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited-Time Discount</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a special launch discount while HDR support is being finalized. Once HDR + more paperplanes &amp; at least 6 more maps added (hopefully more), the price will return to normal—so now’s the perfect time to begin your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paywalls. No pressure. Just pure exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every update is a gift, not a transaction. Whether you're strolling through misty forests or quiet towns, each update brings new places to discover—free of charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple simulation will continue to grow as long as I’m developing games—and as much as I can afford to support it. It’s more than just a standalone experience: this project exists to help fund my larger vision—an action RPG currently in development. Every map in this game is part of that broader universe, offering a peaceful way to explore the worlds I’m building, one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fly, drift, and go sleep to dream.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold your wings and float through vast, hand-crafted landscapes — from quiet towns and shimmering lakes to distant valleys kissed by rainbows and moonlight.<br>In <strong>Paper Dawn: Slumbering Wind</strong>, you guide a paper plane through gentle piano melodies and whispering winds. Every breeze can lift you — or tear you apart. Touch anything, and your delicate craft folds into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric flight simulation</strong> — feel the lightness and fragility of a paper plane.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic wind system</strong> — even a gasp of air can change your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful world</strong> — populated with birds, animals, and soft ambient life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing piano soundtrack</strong> — designed to calm your mind and lull you toward sleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, meditative experience</strong> — no score, no timer, just quiet flight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let go of control. Drift with the wind.<br>Sometimes the softest crash makes the sweetest sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More maps arriving as free DLC to expand your journey.</strong> In this game, you’ll wander through immersive environments originally crafted for other games by the same developer. These maps, once designed for different adventures, now take center stage as peaceful, standalone experiences. Each one invites you to explore at your own pace, accompanied by calming, sleepy music that sets a tranquil tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited-Time Discount</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a special launch discount while HDR support is being finalized. Once HDR + more paperplanes &amp; at least 6 more maps added (hopefully more), the price will return to normal—so now’s the perfect time to begin your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paywalls. No pressure. Just pure exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every update is a gift, not a transaction. Whether you're strolling through misty forests or quiet towns, each update brings new places to discover—free of charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple simulation will continue to grow as long as I’m developing games—and as much as I can afford to support it. It’s more than just a standalone experience: this project exists to help fund my larger vision—an action RPG currently in development. Every map in this game is part of that broader universe, offering a peaceful way to explore the worlds I’m building, one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A peaceful paper plane flight simulator with soft piano music — drift through dreamy skies, forests, and lakes where every breeze can lift or fold you. A cozy, meditative journey meant to calm you to sleep.",
